{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:22 2026-06-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:22 2026-06-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:22 2026-06-04 HKT</p><p>深水埗荔枝角道往美孚方向近北河街交界，今日（6月4日）晚上8時許，一部的士駛經斑馬線時，車頭意外撞到一名過路的中年男子。男子捱撞後昏迷，被送往瑪嘉烈醫院搶救。</p><p>目前意外原因仍在調查，現場所見多名警員在場蒐證，斑馬線有煞車痕跡，司機被帶走問話。</p><img alt=\"的士車頭意外撞到一名過路的中年男子。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e1af55c231fda1beade3138e4a0b87d4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為深水埗荔枝角道往美孚方向近北河街交界過路處。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/393b01fb98a76c7d057474e873264e30/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_27_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為深水埗荔枝角道往美孚方向近北河街交界過路處。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9680f706304393eff81a6ad6c0f6d8ea/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"斑馬線有煞車痕跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c0d213cb36703c5f1f1e7bf0e9b8110/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_25_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場蒐證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2c6ab76cc40a771816eb87f19147978b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_26_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場蒐證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56b1501dd424898c580c74c9ed733a79/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案司機被帶走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e37777846a0e1d22986306aab54add3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_24_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案司機被帶走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5510803df61e50924efb5dca0cad05e1/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_21_05_24_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-04T13:39:03.542442+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}